<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>SAGA - Saga Oil ASA - PRODUCTION UPDATE - CORRECTION!!</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2009-01-16 10:02:56</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Below is a correction from the Production Update posted yesterday, January 15th 2009.<br><br>(Stavanger, 15 January, 2009) <br><br>SAGA Oil ASA sold 7 923 barrels of oil in December.<br><br><br><br>About SAGA Oil ASA<br> <br>SAGA Oil ASA was established in October 2005 to focus on exploration, development and production of oil and gas assets in Russia. SAGA Oil currently holds two production licenses in Orenburg region through its Russian subsidiary.<br> <br>SAGA Oil has it's headquarter in Stavanger, Norway, and has around 60 employees in Norway and Russia. The company's shares are listed at the OTC market (Over the Counter-List) in Oslo, Norway.<br><br>For further information, please contact: <br><br>SAGA Oil ASA – CFO Lasse K Fjell,  +47 51 63 08 00, email: lf@sagaoil.no</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>SAGA - Saga Oil ASA - PRODUKSJONSOPPDATERING</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2009-01-15 10:54:19</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>(Stavanger, 15. januar, 2009) <br><br>SAGA Oil ASA solgte i november 7 923 fat olje. <br><br><br><br>Om SAGA Oil ASA<br>SAGA Oil ASA ble etablert i oktober 2005 for å fokusere på leting, utvikling og produksjon av olje og gass i Russland. SAGA Oil eier gjennom et russisk datterselskap to produksjonslisenser i Orenburg-regionen i Russland.<br><br>SAGA Oil har hovedkontor i Molde, Norge, og har rundt 60 ansatte i Norge og Russland. Selskapets aksjer omsettes på Norsk Fondsmegler Forbunds "Over the Counter-List" (OTC).<br><br>For ytterligere informasjon, vennligst kontakt: <br><br>SAGA Oil ASA – CFO Lasse K Fjell, + 47 51 63 08 00, email: lf@sagaoil.no</p></td>
</tr>
