<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>SAGA - Saga Oil ASA - PRODUCTION UPDATE</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2009-01-15 10:52:40</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>(Stavanger, 15 January, 2009) <br><br>SAGA Oil ASA sold 7 923 barrels of oil in November.<br><br><br><br>About SAGA Oil ASA<br> <br>SAGA Oil ASA was established in October 2005 to focus on exploration, development and production of oil and gas assets in Russia. SAGA Oil currently holds two production licenses in Orenburg region through its Russian subsidiary.<br> <br>SAGA Oil has it's headquarter in Molde, Norway, and has around 60 employees in Norway and Russia. The company's shares are listed at the OTC market (Over the Counter-List) in Oslo, Norway.<br><br>For further information, please contact: <br><br>SAGA Oil ASA – CFO Lasse K Fjell, +47 51 63 08 00, email: lf@sagaoil.no</p></td>
</tr>
