<td><h2>SAGA Oil ASA - Bond Loan in SAGA Oil ASA</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2008-10-31 17:00:02</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>(Stavanger, October 31, 2008)<br><br>SAGA Oil ASA is currently unable to repay the NO 001 032 223.3 17.00<br>per cent SAGA Oil ASA Bond Issue 2006/2008 Call and Warrants Bond<br>Loan with maturity date 31. October 2008<br><br>The Company works with possible solutions.<br><br>SAGA Oil will give updates on progress in due course.<br><br><br><br>About SAGA Oil ASA<br><br>SAGA Oil ASA was established in October 2005 to focus on exploration,<br>development and production of oil and gas assets in Russia and the<br>FSU. SAGA Oil currently holds two production licenses in Orenburg<br>region through its Russian subsidiary.<br>SAGA Oil has it's headquarter in Stavanger, Norway, and has around 80<br>employees in Norway and Russia. The company's shares are listed at<br>the OTC market (Over the Counter-List) in Oslo, Norway.<br><br><br><br>For further information, please contact:<br><br>CEO SAGA Oil ASA                           John-Arne Farstad<br>              Mob:       928 05 733<br>CFO SAGA Oil ASA                         Lasse<br>Fjell                          Mob:       932 48 339<br><br><br>This announcement was originally distributed by Hugin. The issuer is <br>solely responsible for the content of this announcement.</p></td>
</tr>
