<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>Saga Oil ASA: Summons to extraordinary General meeting in Saga Oil<br>ASA</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2008-08-18 15:00:03</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>General meeting of shareholders in Saga Oil ASA will be held on 1<br>September 2008, at 1700 at the Company's offices at Maskinveien 24 in<br>Stavanger.<br><br>The general meeting will be called to order by the chairman of the<br>board, Stig Hetlevik.<br><br>The board of directors have proposed the following agenda:<br><br> 1. Election of chairman of the meeting and representative to co-sign<br>    the minutes<br> 1. Approval of the summon and the agenda<br> 1. Clerification regarding the decision to issue warrants<br> 1. Election of board members<br><br>We kindly ask you to fill out the enclosed registration form/power of<br>attorney and deliver same within 27 August 2008 to Saga Oil ASA,<br>attn. Lasse Fjell either by telefax +47 5163 0799 or by mail to Saga<br>Oil ASA, Maskinveien 24, 4033 Stavanger, or by e-mail to<br>lasse.fjell@sagaoil.no.<br><br><br>                     Stavanger, 18. August 2008<br><br>                    ____________________________<br>                            Stig Hetlevik<br>                        Chairman of the board<br><br>Enclosures:<br><br> 1. To item 3 and 4<br> 1. Registration form/power of attorney</p></td>
</tr>
