<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>SAGA Oil ASA - Melding om kjøp av aksjer i SAGA Oil ASA</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2008-06-25 15:30:03</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Karstein Sie har via sitt deleide selskap Sicom AS, i uke 25 kjøpt<br>179 200 SAGA Oil ASA aksjer til snitt 6,67 kr per aksje. Sicom AS<br>eier nå totalt 482 200 SAGA Oil ASA aksjer , i tillegg eier Sicom AS<br>også 13,42% av Saga Petrol AS. Saga Petrol eier 15 000 000 aksjer i<br>SAGA Oil ASA. Karstein Sie er medgrunder og tidligere styremedlem i<br>SAGA Oil ASA.<br><br><br>Om SAGA Oil ASA<br>SAGA Oil ASA ble etablert i oktober 2005 for å fokusere på leting,<br>utvikling og produksjon av olje og gass i Russland og tidligere<br>Sovjetunionen. Selskapets grunnlegger har mer enn 20 års<br>foretningserfaring innen petroleum industrien fra Russland og<br>tidligere Sovjetunionen. SAGA Oil eier gjennom et russisk<br>datterselskap to produksjonslisenser i Orenburg-regionen i Russland.<br>Selskapet startet produksjon fra den første lisensen i 2007 og vil i<br>løpet av 2008 gradvis øke produksjonen og utvikle det nye lisens<br>areal. SAGA Oil har hovedkontor i Stavanger, Norge, og har rundt 80<br>ansatte i Norge og Russland. Selskapets aksjer omsettes på Norsk<br>Fondsmegler Forbunds "Over the Counter-List" (OTC).<br><br><br>For ytterligere informasjon, vennligst kontakt:<br>SAGA Oil ASA - CEO Mr. Malvin Høydal, cell: +47 97422959, email:<br>malvin.hoeydal@sagaoil.no<br>SAGA Oil ASA - CFO Mr. Lasse Fjell, cell: +47 93249339, email:<br>lf@sagaoil.no<br>SAGA Oil ASA - Investor Relations Mr. Stein Are Valdal, cell: +47 97<br>50 99 82, email: sav@sagaoil.no</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
<a target="_blank" href="http://hugin.info/137028/R/1231065/261620.pdf">
http://hugin.info/137028/R/1231065/261620.pdf</a>
&nbsp;
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td colspan="3"><hr /></td></tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td><h2>SAGA Oil ASA - Purchase of shares in SAGA Oil ASA</h2></td>
<td><h3>Company news</h3></td>
<td align="right"><h3>2008-06-25 15:30:03</h3></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3"><p>Karstein Sie has through his partially owned company Sicom AS,<br>purchased 179 200 shares in SAGA Oil ASA at a price of 6.67 in week<br>25. After this transaction Sicom AS owns 482 200 shares in SAGA Oil<br>ASA, Sicom AS also owns 13,42% of Saga Petrol which owns 15 000 000<br>shares in SAGA Oil ASA. Karstein Sie is co-founder and previous board<br>member of SAGA Oil ASA.<br><br><br>About SAGA Oil ASA<br>SAGA Oil ASA was established in October 2005 to focus on exploration,<br>development and production of oil and gas assets in Russia and the<br>FSU. The company's founder has more than 20 years of business<br>experience in the Soviet Union and Russia. SAGA Oil currently holds<br>two production licenses in Orenburg region through its Russian<br>subsidiary. The company started production from the first license in<br>2007, and it will gradually build up its production during 2008 and<br>will start developing its new acreage. SAGA Oil has it's headquarter<br>in Stavanger, Norway, and has around 80 employees in Norway and<br>Russia. The company's shares are listed at the OTC market (Over the<br>Counter-List) in Oslo, Norway.<br><br><br>For further information, please contact:<br>SAGA Oil ASA - CEO Mr. Malvin Høydal, cell: +47 97422959, email:<br>malvin.hoeydal@sagaoil.no<br>SAGA Oil ASA - CFO Mr. Lasse Fjell, cell: +47 93249339, email:<br>lf@sagaoil.no<br>SAGA Oil ASA - Investor Relations Mr. Stein Are Valdal, cell: +47 97<br>50 99 82, email: sav@sagaoil.no</p></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top">
<td colspan="3" align="right">
