<td colspan="3"><p>Aage Figenschou, the deputy Chairman of SAGA Oil ASA, has March 13.<br>2007 purchased 35 000 shares in SAGA Oil ASA at price NOK 10,25 per<br>share through the company Aage Figenschou AS. Aage Figenschou owns<br>after this a total of 35 000 shares in SAGA Oil ASA.</p></td>
